>> Animal := Walax cusub.
>> Factory := Walax cusub.

Animal marka: ['cusub'] samee: {
	>> animal := naf cusub.
	animal sound: ['?']. <- animal.
}.

Animal marka: ['sound:'] samee: { :s
	iska-leh sound := s.
}.

Animal marka: ['sound'] samee: { <- iska-leh sound.
}.

>> Dog := Walax cusub.
>> Cat := Walax cusub.

Dog marka: ['cusub'] samee: { <- Animal cusub sound: ['woof!'].
}.

Cat marka: ['cusub'] samee: { <- Animal cusub sound: ['meow!'].
}.

Soo-saar qor: Dog cusub sound, sadar-cusub.
Soo-saar qor: Cat cusub sound, sadar-cusub.

Factory marka: ['mix:and:'] samee: { :beast1 :beast2 <- Animal cusub sound: (
		( beast1 sound ka: 0 dherer: 2 ) +
		( beast2 sound ka: 2 dherer: 5 )
	).
}.

Soo-saar qor: (Factory mix: Dog cusub and: Cat cusub) sound, sadar-cusub.
